{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":466254,"name":"","username":"Netanel","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/netanel/{size}/107465_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-15T18:13:20.222Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCursor for iOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot (iOS) — official Vercel marketplace plugin / MCP connector.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI cannot connect the official Vercel plugin (id 649) in Grok Bot. Starting auth opens Vercel’s authorize page and immediately shows:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApp configuration error\u003cbr\u003e\nThe app redirect URL is invalid, please contact the app developer for support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe connector stays needsAuth with 0 tools. This is the same Vercel error as the desktop thread, but this report is specifically for Grok Bot as requested.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelated desktop thread (deanrie asked for a separate Grok Bot thread here):\u003c/p\u003e\u003caside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"159005\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/b5a626/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"quote-title__text-content\"\u003e\n      \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/vercel-mcp-oauth-fails-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid/159005\"\u003eVercel MCP OAuth fails: “App configuration error – redirect URL is invalid”\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/support/bug-report/6\"\u003e\u003cspan data-category-id=\"6\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #652D90; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #12A89D;\" data-parent-category-id=\"21\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --style-square --has-parent\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"badge-category__name\"\u003eBug Reports\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cblockquote\u003e\n    \u003ca name=\"p-386280-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-386280-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\nBugBot \n\u003ca name=\"p-386280-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-386280-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\nI can’t connect Vercel MCP in Cursor because OAuth keeps failing with “The app redirect URL is invalid”. \nAuthorize URL sample: \n\n\u003ca name=\"p-386280-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-386280-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\n\nAdd Vercel MCP via “Add to Cursor”\nIn Cursor, click “Needs login”\nBrowser opens Vercel OAuth authorize page\nError appears: “The app redirect URL is invalid”\n\n\u003ca name=\"p-386280-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-386280-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\nOAuth should complete and return to Cursor via cursor:// callback, then Vercel MCP should connect. \n\u003ca name=\"p-386280-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-386280-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOper…\n  \u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn Grok Bot, install / open the official Vercel plugin (649)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTap Connect / authenticate the Vercel connector\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot opens Vercel OAuth (\u003ca href=\"http://vercel.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003evercel.com\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVercel shows “App configuration error – The app redirect URL is invalid”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuth never completes. Connector remains needsAuth, tools=0\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOAuth should complete and the Vercel connector should become connected with tools available in Grok Bot, same as other official plugins.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/d/1/d1a349420d14014a961422e33f28e124c3d07bd8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/tUxD4Wc1BepLuUfncRzmEFeKgdy.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"vercel-mcp-error.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/1/d1a349420d14014a961422e33f28e124c3d07bd8_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"vercel-mcp-error.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"tUxD4Wc1BepLuUfncRzmEFeKgdy\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/1/d1a349420d14014a961422e33f28e124c3d07bd8_2_230x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/1/d1a349420d14014a961422e33f28e124c3d07bd8_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/d/1/d1a349420d14014a961422e33f28e124c3d07bd8_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"140C0C\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003evercel-mcp-error.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1320×2868 188 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClient: Grok Bot iOS (App Store, Grok Bot 1.0). OS: iOS (iPhone), latest iOS. Plugin: Vercel official marketplace plugin, id 649. Connector status after failure: user-Vercel needsAuth, tools=0, detail=“Authentication required”. Other official plugins in the same Grok Bot session connect fine: Slack, GitHub, Figma, Sentry, Higgsfield, Context7, Supabase, Resend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshot attached (taken in Grok Bot iOS on \u003ca href=\"http://vercel.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003evercel.com\u003c/a\u003e during the connect flow).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis matches Ahmet’s Aug 11 note on the desktop thread (plugin 649, Grok Bot, needsAuth / tools=0). Other OAuth plugins work in the same session, so this is isolated to Vercel’s authorize/redirect, not a general Grok Bot OAuth break.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease whitelist Grok Bot / Cursor’s OAuth redirect URI on the Vercel MCP OAuth client (previously cited client_id=cl_KcWL599JrCOhI4n2lXPJJ8rkF4SqSbOf / cursor://anysphere.cursor-mcp/oauth/callback), or use a Grok Bot-compatible HTTPS redirect. Happy to ping Vercel support as well.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor: No — Cursor / Grok Bot work, but the Vercel connector cannot be used from Grok Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-466254-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-466254-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":8,"updated_at":"2026-08-18T12:25:11.770Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":79,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":412.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":168499,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-vercel-plugin-649-oauth-fails-with-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://vercel.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Agentic Infrastructure - Vercel","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/vercel-mcp-oauth-fails-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid/159005","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Vercel MCP OAuth fails: “App configuration error – redirect URL is invalid”","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-inkbox-connect-card-fails-with-unsupported-redirect-uri/170725","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot: Inkbox connect card fails with Unsupported redirect_uri","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-ios-vercel-plugin-sheet-stuck-on-added-after-uninstall-re-add-force-quit-required/172380","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot iOS: Vercel plugin sheet stuck on \"Added\" after uninstall/re-add (force-quit required)","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/vercel-mcp-oauth-fails-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid/159005/10","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Vercel MCP OAuth fails: “App configuration error – redirect URL is invalid”","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-official-x-plugin-oauth-fails-with-something-went-wrong-failed-to-give-the-app-access/168501","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot: official X plugin OAuth fails with “Something went wrong / failed to give the app access”","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-official-x-plugin-oauth-fails-with-something-went-wrong-failed-to-give-the-app-access/168501/10","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot: official X plugin OAuth fails with “Something went wrong / failed to give the app access”","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":114298,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-vercel-plugin-649-oauth-fails-with-app-configuration-error-redirect-url-is-invalid/168499/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":466469,"name":"","username":"Netanel","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/netanel/{size}/107465_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-16T07:15:34.214Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eUpdate: retrying Vercel plugin auth in Grok Bot now hits a different error page (looks like the Grok Bot / Cursor callback, not Vercel’s “redirect URL is invalid” screen):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOAuth callback failed.\u003cbr\u003e\nClose this tab and try connecting again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eScreenshot attached. Connector is still needsAuth / tools=0 on plugin 649. Still cannot authorize Vercel in Grok Bot.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/b/2/b2b9fa9cb609449ba0b26172c78c2a2282d795c0.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/pv5rLnO2H0XAoKQ7LCn6Nl76ieQ.png?dl=1\" title=\"vercel-oauth-callback-failed\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/2/b2b9fa9cb609449ba0b26172c78c2a2282d795c0_2_690x458.png\" alt=\"vercel-oauth-callback-failed\" data-base62-sha1=\"pv5rLnO2H0XAoKQ7LCn6Nl76ieQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"458\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/2/b2b9fa9cb609449ba0b26172c78c2a2282d795c0_2_690x458.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/2/b2b9fa9cb609449ba0b26172c78c2a2282d795c0_2_1035x687.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/b/2/b2b9fa9cb609449ba0b26172c78c2a2282d795c0_2_1380x916.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"0D0D0D\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003evercel-oauth-callback-failed\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2386×1584 95.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa